# Molten Note: "If the target is illegal, nothing happens" (CR 608.2b). Bot1 taps Llanowar Elves for {G}, then casts the Note on
# Bot2's Hill Giant and Lightning Bolts the Giant in response. The Note has no legal target and does not resolve: the Elves stay
# tapped and the Note goes to the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Molten Note
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Hill Giant
Forest x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
